  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "上集盘到第六，今开第五到第一。绍兴两千五百年不挪，成都三千年不改名，南京六倒六起，西安地下盛唐，洛阳凭啥第一#中国历史名城#历史#洛阳#成都",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_91daf49276265978_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 494.098005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了第十到第六开封底下压着六座城，徐州攒齐两汉文明曲阜定义了礼乐中国，平遥，卧着丽江没城墙，反而活成了世界遗产。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说绍兴呢成都呢、洛阳呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一一一个比一个厚。最后那个中国古都学会给他立碑，写的是华夏第一王都。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，浙江绍兴春秋越国都城。公元前四百九十年，越王勾践让大夫范蠡建城，到今天两千五百多年了，这城最绝的地方不是老是他两千五百年城旨没挪过窝，格局没大变过，全国找不出第二座这样的城跟他一样老的只有苏州范蠡当年建成暗座西朝东的周至依着山水形事，选了四通八达，地方很便利。两千五百年过去了，绍兴人还在原来的地方住着，还在原来的河道里，遥无篷船古城里，到现在还有八百多条河六百多座桥。有句老话叫，三山万户向盘曲柏桥，千阶水纵横。您想想，两千年了，河还是那条河桥，还是那座桥，人还是住在老地方，这城不是箭在地上，是长在地里的这地方，还叫名仕之乡。王羲之在这儿写了兰亭序，陆游在这儿写下死去。元知万事空，鲁迅，从这儿走出去，明清，两朝绍兴师爷遍布全国。有句话叫，无哨不成牙，全国衙门里差不多都有绍兴人，一座城，把江南的骨和魂全泡在黄酒里了。第四名，四川成都古蜀文明的发祥地，蜀汉都城因蜀锦得名。锦官城这城三千多年没改过名字，没挪过位置，您知道这意味着什么吗？三千年里战火也烧过，大水，也淹过，改朝换代多少回，他还在那儿名字不变，位置不变。成都这个名字怎么来的？古书上写着一年成聚二年，成义三年，成都意思是住一年就成了村子，住两年就成了镇子，住三年就成了都城，就这么简单。旁边的都江堰两千两百多年了，还在给成都平原灌水，到现在灌溉一千多万亩农田养活三千多万人。天府之国四个字就是这么来的。杜甫草堂武侯祠青城山一座城，把诗和远方全占了，这是您上哪说理去？第三名，江苏南京，六朝古都十朝都会东吴、东晋宋齐梁陈，加上南唐明初太平天国，民国先后十个朝代在这儿建都秦淮河。从城中间留过蒋声登营礼，藏着半部中国史，虎踞龙盘的地势，让每个想守住江南的王朝都往这儿跑。但南京也是座商城建成两千五百多年，他被毁过六次，苏郡叛乱，侯景叛乱，隋朝灭臣金兵南下太平天国，还有侵华日军一次一次把他推倒最惨的一次，全城二十八万户死了将近八成。可是每一次他都从废墟上又站起来了。您站在名城墙上看一眼长江，就明白什么叫厚重一座城的命运，跟一个民族的命运拴在一起。第二名，陕西西安十三朝古都西周琴西汉隋唐全在这儿。建都丝绸之路从这儿出发，跟罗马雅典开罗。并称世界四大古都这城最邪乎的不是地上，是地下西安人挖地铁，挖着挖着就挖到老祖宗家门口了。地铁二号线短短二十五公里，挖出来一百三十多座古墓。从汉代到明代，一层压一层修修停停，本来几年能干完的活，硬是拖了十八年。地铁八号线更吓人。勘探发现，一千三百多座古墓，施工队都习惯了一铲子下去，先得给文物局打电话。兵马俑、大雁塔、大明宫遗址地下埋的是整个中华文明的精神故乡。有人说，西安的土都是文物，挖地铁，比考古队还忙。一座城撑起了中国最强盛那些朝代的门面。第一名。河南洛阳十三朝古都从夏朝开始，东周东汉曹魏西晋，北魏隋唐，一个接一个在这儿定都建都史、一千五百年中国历史上，建都最早、朝代最多、历史最长的城市，沿漯河一线。从东到西，排着五座都城遗址、夏都二里头、偃狮商城、东周王城捍卫洛阳城隋唐洛阳城，这叫武都贿赂。全世界找不出第二处，二里头遗址被叫做华夏第一王都。那里有中国最早的工程，最早的城市干道网，最早的中轴线布局，最早的青铜礼器群。中国的王朝文明就是从那儿开的头。龙门石窟凿了四百多年，现存两千多个枯堪十万多尊造像。白马寺是中国第一座官办寺院，牡丹花开了一千多年中国古都，学会给他立碑，写的是华夏第一王都，别的城再牛，论资排辈都得往后站。您听出来了没有？这十座城没有一座是靠楼高出名的洛阳靠的是华夏第一王都，西安靠的是地底下埋着的盛堂。南京靠的是六次推倒又六次站起来，成都靠的是三千年，不改名不挪窝。绍兴靠的是两千五百年，城址没变。丽江靠的是水，穿城过马帮铃响。平遥靠的是票号，汇通天下，曲阜靠的是孔子立的规矩。徐州靠的是两汉的魂。开封靠的是地下摞着六座城，每一座城的厉害之处都不在地面上。在故事里点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00002",
      "start_ms": 850,
      "end_ms": 5850,
      "text": "咱们盘了第十到第六开封底下压着六座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6230,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "徐州攒齐两汉文明曲阜定义了礼乐中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12690,
      "end_ms": 13210,
      "text": "平遥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13410,
      "end_ms": 15670,
      "text": "卧着丽江没城墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16129,
      "end_ms": 18290,
      "text": "反而活成了世界遗产。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19330,
      "end_ms": 22010,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22710,
      "end_ms": 26070,
      "text": "有人说绍兴呢成都呢、洛阳呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26190,
      "end_ms": 26670,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27470,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一一一个比一个厚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32160,
      "end_ms": 35560,
      "text": "最后那个中国古都学会给他立碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 38240,
      "text": "写的是华夏第一王都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38380,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42920,
      "end_ms": 44760,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00015",
      "start_ms": 45480,
      "end_ms": 46139,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46540,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "浙江绍兴春秋越国都城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49620,
      "end_ms": 51240,
      "text": "公元前四百九十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51720,
      "end_ms": 54640,
      "text": "越王勾践让大夫范蠡建城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55080,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "到今天两千五百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57620,
      "end_ms": 63425,
      "text": "这城最绝的地方不是老是他两千五百年城旨没挪过窝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63800,
      "end_ms": 65035,
      "text": "格局没大变过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00022",
      "start_ms": 65460,
      "end_ms": 76815,
      "text": "全国找不出第二座这样的城跟他一样老的只有苏州范蠡当年建成暗座西朝东的周至依着山水形事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00023",
      "start_ms": 77170,
      "end_ms": 78595,
      "text": "选了四通八达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00024",
      "start_ms": 79170,
      "end_ms": 80315,
      "text": "地方很便利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00025",
      "start_ms": 80730,
      "end_ms": 82215,
      "text": "两千五百年过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00026",
      "start_ms": 82530,
      "end_ms": 85505,
      "text": "绍兴人还在原来的地方住着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00027",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 87055,
      "text": "还在原来的河道里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00028",
      "start_ms": 87600,
      "end_ms": 89820,
      "text": "遥无篷船古城里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00029",
      "start_ms": 89820,
      "end_ms": 93625,
      "text": "到现在还有八百多条河六百多座桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94170,
      "end_ms": 95205,
      "text": "有句老话叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00031",
      "start_ms": 95560,
      "end_ms": 98880,
      "text": "三山万户向盘曲柏桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00032",
      "start_ms": 98920,
      "end_ms": 100195,
      "text": "千阶水纵横。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00033",
      "start_ms": 100750,
      "end_ms": 101450,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00034",
      "start_ms": 101710,
      "end_ms": 102635,
      "text": "两千年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00035",
      "start_ms": 103110,
      "end_ms": 104890,
      "text": "河还是那条河桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00036",
      "start_ms": 105030,
      "end_ms": 105890,
      "text": "还是那座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00037",
      "start_ms": 106250,
      "end_ms": 108365,
      "text": "人还是住在老地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00038",
      "start_ms": 108650,
      "end_ms": 110655,
      "text": "这城不是箭在地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110830,
      "end_ms": 112890,
      "text": "是长在地里的这地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00040",
      "start_ms": 112890,
      "end_ms": 114685,
      "text": "还叫名仕之乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00041",
      "start_ms": 115370,
      "end_ms": 117640,
      "text": "王羲之在这儿写了兰亭序，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117840,
      "end_ms": 120380,
      "text": "陆游在这儿写下死去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120380,
      "end_ms": 121635,
      "text": "元知万事空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122020,
      "end_ms": 122380,
      "text": "鲁迅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00045",
      "start_ms": 122380,
      "end_ms": 123735,
      "text": "从这儿走出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00046",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 124680,
      "text": "明清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00047",
      "start_ms": 124760,
      "end_ms": 128405,
      "text": "两朝绍兴师爷遍布全国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00048",
      "start_ms": 129030,
      "end_ms": 129850,
      "text": "有句话叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130010,
      "end_ms": 131365,
      "text": "无哨不成牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131850,
      "end_ms": 134655,
      "text": "全国衙门里差不多都有绍兴人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00051",
      "start_ms": 135400,
      "end_ms": 136060,
      "text": "一座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136400,
      "end_ms": 139955,
      "text": "把江南的骨和魂全泡在黄酒里了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00053",
      "start_ms": 140550,
      "end_ms": 141185,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00054",
      "start_ms": 141640,
      "end_ms": 144735,
      "text": "四川成都古蜀文明的发祥地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145110,
      "end_ms": 148250,
      "text": "蜀汉都城因蜀锦得名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00056",
      "start_ms": 148550,
      "end_ms": 152650,
      "text": "锦官城这城三千多年没改过名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152750,
      "end_ms": 153805,
      "text": "没挪过位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00058",
      "start_ms": 154860,
      "end_ms": 156515,
      "text": "您知道这意味着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00059",
      "start_ms": 157380,
      "end_ms": 160425,
      "text": "三千年里战火也烧过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00060",
      "start_ms": 160960,
      "end_ms": 161440,
      "text": "大水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00061",
      "start_ms": 161440,
      "end_ms": 162265,
      "text": "也淹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00062",
      "start_ms": 163040,
      "end_ms": 165095,
      "text": "改朝换代多少回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00063",
      "start_ms": 165690,
      "end_ms": 167445,
      "text": "他还在那儿名字不变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167760,
      "end_ms": 168520,
      "text": "位置不变。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00065",
      "start_ms": 168700,
      "end_ms": 170625,
      "text": "成都这个名字怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00066",
      "start_ms": 171110,
      "end_ms": 174020,
      "text": "古书上写着一年成聚二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00067",
      "start_ms": 174080,
      "end_ms": 175240,
      "text": "成义三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00068",
      "start_ms": 175320,
      "end_ms": 178795,
      "text": "成都意思是住一年就成了村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00069",
      "start_ms": 179250,
      "end_ms": 180855,
      "text": "住两年就成了镇子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00070",
      "start_ms": 181580,
      "end_ms": 183455,
      "text": "住三年就成了都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00071",
      "start_ms": 183940,
      "end_ms": 184725,
      "text": "就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00072",
      "start_ms": 185420,
      "end_ms": 188625,
      "text": "旁边的都江堰两千两百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00073",
      "start_ms": 188860,
      "end_ms": 191375,
      "text": "还在给成都平原灌水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00074",
      "start_ms": 191690,
      "end_ms": 197545,
      "text": "到现在灌溉一千多万亩农田养活三千多万人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00075",
      "start_ms": 198360,
      "end_ms": 201155,
      "text": "天府之国四个字就是这么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00076",
      "start_ms": 202750,
      "end_ms": 207430,
      "text": "杜甫草堂武侯祠青城山一座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207430,
      "end_ms": 209765,
      "text": "把诗和远方全占了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00078",
      "start_ms": 210610,
      "end_ms": 213435,
      "text": "这是您上哪说理去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00079",
      "start_ms": 214370,
      "end_ms": 215085,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00080",
      "start_ms": 215460,
      "end_ms": 216360,
      "text": "江苏南京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00081",
      "start_ms": 216640,
      "end_ms": 221995,
      "text": "六朝古都十朝都会东吴、东晋宋齐梁陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00082",
      "start_ms": 222560,
      "end_ms": 226365,
      "text": "加上南唐明初太平天国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00083",
      "start_ms": 227160,
      "end_ms": 232550,
      "text": "民国先后十个朝代在这儿建都秦淮河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00084",
      "start_ms": 232910,
      "end_ms": 235915,
      "text": "从城中间留过蒋声登营礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00085",
      "start_ms": 236290,
      "end_ms": 237865,
      "text": "藏着半部中国史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00086",
      "start_ms": 238210,
      "end_ms": 239785,
      "text": "虎踞龙盘的地势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00087",
      "start_ms": 240450,
      "end_ms": 244005,
      "text": "让每个想守住江南的王朝都往这儿跑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00088",
      "start_ms": 244700,
      "end_ms": 248135,
      "text": "但南京也是座商城建成两千五百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00089",
      "start_ms": 248690,
      "end_ms": 250005,
      "text": "他被毁过六次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00090",
      "start_ms": 250430,
      "end_ms": 251435,
      "text": "苏郡叛乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00091",
      "start_ms": 251770,
      "end_ms": 252815,
      "text": "侯景叛乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00092",
      "start_ms": 253330,
      "end_ms": 256790,
      "text": "隋朝灭臣金兵南下太平天国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00093",
      "start_ms": 257150,
      "end_ms": 262365,
      "text": "还有侵华日军一次一次把他推倒最惨的一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00094",
      "start_ms": 262710,
      "end_ms": 266255,
      "text": "全城二十八万户死了将近八成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00095",
      "start_ms": 266730,
      "end_ms": 270765,
      "text": "可是每一次他都从废墟上又站起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00096",
      "start_ms": 271950,
      "end_ms": 274735,
      "text": "您站在名城墙上看一眼长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00097",
      "start_ms": 275080,
      "end_ms": 278155,
      "text": "就明白什么叫厚重一座城的命运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00098",
      "start_ms": 278390,
      "end_ms": 280765,
      "text": "跟一个民族的命运拴在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00099",
      "start_ms": 281540,
      "end_ms": 282085,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00100",
      "start_ms": 282540,
      "end_ms": 289450,
      "text": "陕西西安十三朝古都西周琴西汉隋唐全在这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00101",
      "start_ms": 289450,
      "end_ms": 292490,
      "text": "建都丝绸之路从这儿出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00102",
      "start_ms": 292710,
      "end_ms": 294985,
      "text": "跟罗马雅典开罗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00103",
      "start_ms": 295870,
      "end_ms": 300290,
      "text": "并称世界四大古都这城最邪乎的不是地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00104",
      "start_ms": 300670,
      "end_ms": 303769,
      "text": "是地下西安人挖地铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00105",
      "start_ms": 304030,
      "end_ms": 307590,
      "text": "挖着挖着就挖到老祖宗家门口了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00106",
      "start_ms": 307630,
      "end_ms": 310110,
      "text": "地铁二号线短短二十五公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00107",
      "start_ms": 311010,
      "end_ms": 313450,
      "text": "挖出来一百三十多座古墓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00108",
      "start_ms": 313770,
      "end_ms": 315550,
      "text": "从汉代到明代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00109",
      "start_ms": 315870,
      "end_ms": 318130,
      "text": "一层压一层修修停停，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00110",
      "start_ms": 318570,
      "end_ms": 320330,
      "text": "本来几年能干完的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320630,
      "end_ms": 322130,
      "text": "硬是拖了十八年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00112",
      "start_ms": 322710,
      "end_ms": 324350,
      "text": "地铁八号线更吓人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00113",
      "start_ms": 324650,
      "end_ms": 325515,
      "text": "勘探发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00114",
      "start_ms": 326200,
      "end_ms": 328320,
      "text": "一千三百多座古墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00115",
      "start_ms": 328820,
      "end_ms": 331680,
      "text": "施工队都习惯了一铲子下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00116",
      "start_ms": 332060,
      "end_ms": 334360,
      "text": "先得给文物局打电话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00117",
      "start_ms": 334740,
      "end_ms": 343760,
      "text": "兵马俑、大雁塔、大明宫遗址地下埋的是整个中华文明的精神故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00118",
      "start_ms": 343960,
      "end_ms": 344540,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00119",
      "start_ms": 344760,
      "end_ms": 346460,
      "text": "西安的土都是文物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00120",
      "start_ms": 346640,
      "end_ms": 347360,
      "text": "挖地铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00121",
      "start_ms": 347640,
      "end_ms": 349620,
      "text": "比考古队还忙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00122",
      "start_ms": 349920,
      "end_ms": 355375,
      "text": "一座城撑起了中国最强盛那些朝代的门面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00123",
      "start_ms": 355830,
      "end_ms": 356435,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00124",
      "start_ms": 356790,
      "end_ms": 361825,
      "text": "河南洛阳十三朝古都从夏朝开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00125",
      "start_ms": 362220,
      "end_ms": 364950,
      "text": "东周东汉曹魏西晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00126",
      "start_ms": 365110,
      "end_ms": 366310,
      "text": "北魏隋唐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00127",
      "start_ms": 366550,
      "end_ms": 373320,
      "text": "一个接一个在这儿定都建都史、一千五百年中国历史上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00128",
      "start_ms": 373520,
      "end_ms": 377595,
      "text": "建都最早、朝代最多、历史最长的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00129",
      "start_ms": 378020,
      "end_ms": 379495,
      "text": "沿漯河一线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00130",
      "start_ms": 379900,
      "end_ms": 381080,
      "text": "从东到西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00131",
      "start_ms": 381500,
      "end_ms": 392045,
      "text": "排着五座都城遗址、夏都二里头、偃狮商城、东周王城捍卫洛阳城隋唐洛阳城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00132",
      "start_ms": 392450,
      "end_ms": 394165,
      "text": "这叫武都贿赂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00133",
      "start_ms": 394600,
      "end_ms": 397945,
      "text": "全世界找不出第二处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00134",
      "start_ms": 398240,
      "end_ms": 401925,
      "text": "二里头遗址被叫做华夏第一王都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00135",
      "start_ms": 402370,
      "end_ms": 404825,
      "text": "那里有中国最早的工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00136",
      "start_ms": 405170,
      "end_ms": 407025,
      "text": "最早的城市干道网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00137",
      "start_ms": 407700,
      "end_ms": 409575,
      "text": "最早的中轴线布局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00138",
      "start_ms": 409980,
      "end_ms": 411725,
      "text": "最早的青铜礼器群。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00139",
      "start_ms": 412190,
      "end_ms": 415445,
      "text": "中国的王朝文明就是从那儿开的头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00140",
      "start_ms": 415920,
      "end_ms": 418325,
      "text": "龙门石窟凿了四百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00141",
      "start_ms": 418780,
      "end_ms": 422525,
      "text": "现存两千多个枯堪十万多尊造像。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00142",
      "start_ms": 423020,
      "end_ms": 426830,
      "text": "白马寺是中国第一座官办寺院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00143",
      "start_ms": 426990,
      "end_ms": 430870,
      "text": "牡丹花开了一千多年中国古都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00144",
      "start_ms": 430870,
      "end_ms": 433065,
      "text": "学会给他立碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00145",
      "start_ms": 433960,
      "end_ms": 437135,
      "text": "写的是华夏第一王都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00146",
      "start_ms": 438060,
      "end_ms": 439325,
      "text": "别的城再牛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00147",
      "start_ms": 440270,
      "end_ms": 443125,
      "text": "论资排辈都得往后站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00148",
      "start_ms": 443520,
      "end_ms": 444645,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00149",
      "start_ms": 445040,
      "end_ms": 451375,
      "text": "这十座城没有一座是靠楼高出名的洛阳靠的是华夏第一王都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00150",
      "start_ms": 451940,
      "end_ms": 454920,
      "text": "西安靠的是地底下埋着的盛堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00151",
      "start_ms": 455220,
      "end_ms": 459375,
      "text": "南京靠的是六次推倒又六次站起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00152",
      "start_ms": 460190,
      "end_ms": 462370,
      "text": "成都靠的是三千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00153",
      "start_ms": 462370,
      "end_ms": 463965,
      "text": "不改名不挪窝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00154",
      "start_ms": 464620,
      "end_ms": 467310,
      "text": "绍兴靠的是两千五百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00155",
      "start_ms": 467330,
      "end_ms": 468070,
      "text": "城址没变。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00156",
      "start_ms": 468230,
      "end_ms": 470000,
      "text": "丽江靠的是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00157",
      "start_ms": 470040,
      "end_ms": 471955,
      "text": "穿城过马帮铃响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00158",
      "start_ms": 472320,
      "end_ms": 474420,
      "text": "平遥靠的是票号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00159",
      "start_ms": 474480,
      "end_ms": 475455,
      "text": "汇通天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00160",
      "start_ms": 475930,
      "end_ms": 478765,
      "text": "曲阜靠的是孔子立的规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00161",
      "start_ms": 479240,
      "end_ms": 482025,
      "text": "徐州靠的是两汉的魂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00162",
      "start_ms": 482510,
      "end_ms": 485985,
      "text": "开封靠的是地下摞着六座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00163",
      "start_ms": 486560,
      "end_ms": 489825,
      "text": "每一座城的厉害之处都不在地面上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00164",
      "start_ms": 490510,
      "end_ms": 492365,
      "text": "在故事里点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_91daf49276265978_s00165",
      "start_ms": 492670,
      "end_ms": 493965,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
